    <briefdescription>
<para>Factory for creating and verifying detection engines. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Enforces PKI-based plugin security:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Verifies plugin signatures before instantiation</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Rejects unsigned or tampered configurations</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Logs all verification attempts for audit trail </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
